  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Nicaragua Social Protection</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objectives of the Project are to: (i) improve the basic conditions of welfare and social well-being of extremely  poor beneficiary  families with children in Selected Poor Localities; (ii) strengthen the capacity of MIFAN to implement the family andcommunity-based social welfare Model; and (iii) promote pre-school and primary school attendance through the provision of schoollunches.</narrative>
  </description>
